                           <rdf:li><rdf:Description xmpDM:startTime="202133" tscIQ:feedback="1" tscIQ:questionSetName="Quiz 1"><tscIQ:questions><rdf:Seq><rdf:li><rdf:Description tscIQ:type="MC" tscIQ:id="0"><tscIQ:question>Only Native American veterans are eligible for a Native American Direct Loan (NADL).</tscIQ:question><tscIQ:correctAnswer>2</tscIQ:correctAnswer><tscIQ:answerArray><rdf:Seq><rdf:li><rdf:Description tscIQ:orderId="0"><tscIQ:answer>True</tscIQ:answer></rdf:Description></rdf:li><rdf:li><rdf:Description tscIQ:orderId="1"><tscIQ:answer>False</tscIQ:answer></rdf:Description></rdf:li></rdf:Seq></tscIQ:answerArray><tscIQ:feedback><rdf:Bag><rdf:li><rdf:Description tscIQ:reason="correct"><xmpDM:name><rdf:Alt><rdf:li>Correct! A Native American veteran or a non-Native American veteran married to a Native American can be eligible for a Native American Direct Loan (NADL).</rdf:li></rdf:Alt></xmpDM:name></rdf:Description></rdf:li><rdf:li><rdf:Description tscIQ:reason="incorrect" tscIQ:jumpToTime="33000"><xmpDM:name><rdf:Alt><rdf:li>False. A Native American veteran or a non-Native American veteran married to a Native American can be eligible for a Native American Direct Loan (NADL).</rdf:li></rdf:Alt></xmpDM:name></rdf:Description></rdf:li></rdf:Bag></tscIQ:feedback></rdf:Description></rdf:li><rdf:li><rdf:Description tscIQ:type="MC" tscIQ:id="1"><tscIQ:question>There are no additional fees with a Native American Direct Loan (NADL).</tscIQ:question><tscIQ:correctAnswer>2</tscIQ:correctAnswer><tscIQ:answerArray><rdf:Seq><rdf:li><rdf:Description tscIQ:orderId="0"><tscIQ:answer>True</tscIQ:answer></rdf:Description></rdf:li><rdf:li><rdf:Description tscIQ:orderId="1"><tscIQ:answer>False</tscIQ:answer></rdf:Description></rdf:li></rdf:Seq></tscIQ:answerArray><tscIQ:feedback><rdf:Bag><rdf:li><rdf:Description tscIQ:reason="correct"><xmpDM:name><rdf:Alt><rdf:li>Correct. A Native American Direct Loan (NADL) will include interest on the loan, closing costs, and a possible one-time VA funding fee.</rdf:li></rdf:Alt></xmpDM:name></rdf:Description></rdf:li><rdf:li><rdf:Description tscIQ:reason="incorrect" tscIQ:jumpToTime="61000"><xmpDM:name><rdf:Alt><rdf:li>False. A Native American Direct Loan (NADL) will include interest on the loan, closing costs, and a possible one-time VA funding fee.</rdf:li></rdf:Alt></xmpDM:name></rdf:Description></rdf:li></rdf:Bag></tscIQ:feedback></rdf:Description></rdf:li><rdf:li><rdf:Description tscIQ:type="MC" tscIQ:id="2"><tscIQ:question>Tribes recognized by a State, but not by the Federal Government, are eligible for this program.</tscIQ:question><tscIQ:correctAnswer>2</tscIQ:correctAnswer><tscIQ:answerArray><rdf:Seq><rdf:li><rdf:Description tscIQ:orderId="0"><tscIQ:answer>True</tscIQ:answer></rdf:Description></rdf:li><rdf:li><rdf:Description tscIQ:orderId="1"><tscIQ:answer>False</tscIQ:answer></rdf:Description></rdf:li></rdf:Seq></tscIQ:answerArray><tscIQ:feedback><rdf:Bag><rdf:li><rdf:Description tscIQ:reason="correct"><xmpDM:name><rdf:Alt><rdf:li>Correct. Tribes recognized by a State, but not by the Federal Government, are NOT eligible for this program.</rdf:li></rdf:Alt></xmpDM:name></rdf:Description></rdf:li><rdf:li><rdf:Description tscIQ:reason="incorrect" tscIQ:jumpToTime="107000"><xmpDM:name><rdf:Alt><rdf:li>False. Tribes recognized by a State, but not by the Federal Government, are NOT eligible for this program.</rdf:li></rdf:Alt></xmpDM:name></rdf:Description></rdf:li></rdf:Bag></tscIQ:feedback></rdf:Description></rdf:li><rdf:li><rdf:Description tscIQ:type="MC" tscIQ:id="3"><tscIQ:question>The first step to obtain a Native American Direct Loan (NADL) is to contact an NADL coordinator. </tscIQ:question><tscIQ:correctAnswer>2</tscIQ:correctAnswer><tscIQ:answerArray><rdf:Seq><rdf:li><rdf:Description tscIQ:orderId="0"><tscIQ:answer>True</tscIQ:answer></rdf:Description></rdf:li><rdf:li><rdf:Description tscIQ:orderId="1"><tscIQ:answer>False</tscIQ:answer></rdf:Description></rdf:li></rdf:Seq></tscIQ:answe